Package: graph
Version: __VERSION__
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: __ARCH__
Maintainer: willgcr <hello@willgcr.me>
Depends: libc6
Suggests: samba, cifs-utils
Homepage: https://wrklabs.org/graph
Description: filesystem repository shared over SMB
 graph initialises an ordinary directory as a repository for documents,
 records, notes and media, serves it over SMB through Samba, and mounts
 it from other machines. The repository stays a plain directory tree,
 readable and editable with the tools already on the system.
